WEBVTT

00:06.589 --> 00:08.967
Are you okay, honey?

00:10.760 --> 00:11.845
Honey?

00:15.724 --> 00:16.683
Stop!

02:00.245 --> 02:01.996
What's going on here?

02:02.413 --> 02:03.748
There... There's blood!

02:05.959 --> 02:07.752
Stop!

02:15.552 --> 02:16.636
Honey.

02:17.387 --> 02:20.140
Ma'am, you're in great danger.

02:20.306 --> 02:23.518
Wrap your wound with cloth
and hold it tight.

02:27.647 --> 02:28.773
It's okay.

02:28.857 --> 02:30.275
There must be a way to cure you.

02:30.650 --> 02:32.569
The wife's wound shouldn't be fatal.

02:33.027 --> 02:34.195
Harder!

02:34.487 --> 02:37.198
Hold it harder.
Bind the cloth with a rope.

02:37.490 --> 02:38.908
You're going to be okay.

02:39.242 --> 02:41.161
This man hasn't killed anyone.

02:43.329 --> 02:47.417
He was just an ordinary passerby
just a moment ago.

02:49.043 --> 02:50.336
Are you all right?

02:50.628 --> 02:52.088
Don't look.

02:52.547 --> 02:55.425
It's dangerous here, Rei.
Let's go somewhere else.

02:55.508 --> 02:56.551
What about him?

03:09.939 --> 03:12.525
Damn it.

03:16.237 --> 03:18.364
I can't leave this one behind.

03:19.449 --> 03:21.075
Muzan Kibutsuji!

03:21.576 --> 03:23.494
No matter where you go,

03:23.745 --> 03:26.122
I'll never let you off the hook!

03:27.040 --> 03:29.042
What's with that boy?

03:29.542 --> 03:31.002
Do you know him, Tsukihiko?

03:35.256 --> 03:37.091
You'll never get away from me!

03:37.342 --> 03:41.804
I'll pursue you to the depth of hell
and I'll cut off your head with my sword!

03:42.013 --> 03:44.349
I'll never forgive you!

03:45.058 --> 03:47.268
Hey! What are you up to?

03:47.352 --> 03:48.519
Are they drunk?

03:48.895 --> 03:51.022
Hey, kid. Get off that man.

03:51.105 --> 03:52.106
No.

03:52.190 --> 03:53.983
Get me some fetters, please.

03:54.067 --> 03:54.943
I beg you.

03:55.026 --> 03:56.444
That's enough. Get up.

03:56.527 --> 03:57.946
Please, don't.

03:58.112 --> 04:00.114
Only I can constrain this man.

04:00.198 --> 04:01.074
Move aside!

04:01.157 --> 04:02.408
Please don't!

04:02.492 --> 04:04.827
Goodness, what happened to his face?

04:04.911 --> 04:06.496
Did he lose his mind?

04:06.829 --> 04:08.498
Take the boy away.

04:08.581 --> 04:09.874
Please stop!

04:09.958 --> 04:12.669
I don't want him to kill anyone.

04:12.752 --> 04:14.379
Please let me do my work.

04:14.462 --> 04:15.964
I beg you, gentlemen.

04:16.381 --> 04:20.468
Damn! If you resist us again...

04:27.725 --> 04:31.062
Enchanting Blood, Aroma of Visual Fantasy.

04:32.480 --> 04:34.649
What is this aroma?

04:35.775 --> 04:37.527
What are these patterns?

04:40.446 --> 04:41.489
What's going on?

04:41.572 --> 04:43.116
I can't see anything around me.

04:44.200 --> 04:45.660
Is this some kind of attack?

04:45.994 --> 04:47.245
If it is, that's not good.

04:49.163 --> 04:50.748
The smell is getting stronger.

04:59.632 --> 05:03.344
You still call someone a human

05:04.053 --> 05:07.348
even if he has turned into a demon

05:08.057 --> 05:10.101
and you will do your best to save him.

05:11.769 --> 05:14.939
So let me give you a helping hand.

05:16.024 --> 05:17.191
Why are you doing this?

05:17.650 --> 05:18.776
Who are you?

05:18.943 --> 05:20.194
Your scent, it's...

05:21.195 --> 05:23.531
That's right. I am...

05:26.409 --> 05:28.369
a demon, but I'm also a healer.

05:29.329 --> 05:33.583
I'm also bent on eradicating
a certain Muzan Kibutsuji.

05:38.337 --> 05:40.048
You're not coming along, Dad?

05:40.631 --> 05:42.216
I have work to do,

05:42.550 --> 05:44.552
so I have to go somewhere else.

05:44.969 --> 05:47.263
It was a huge commotion back there.

05:47.972 --> 05:49.182
Honey.

05:49.474 --> 05:50.600
It's okay.

05:50.808 --> 05:53.061
I'm just going to talk to the police.

05:53.686 --> 05:54.979
Okay, go inside.

05:58.816 --> 06:01.319
Come home early, Dad.

06:01.527 --> 06:03.821
I will. Be a good girl.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.782
Send them home, please.

06:06.282 --> 06:07.325
You may go now.

06:20.671 --> 06:23.424
Dude, let's hit another bar!

06:23.508 --> 06:25.760
Yachan, are you okay?

06:25.843 --> 06:27.595
I'm fine.

06:27.762 --> 06:30.348
I'm not drunk yet--

06:30.515 --> 06:32.225
What the hell?

06:35.686 --> 06:36.854
Excuse me.

06:41.609 --> 06:42.735
Stop!

06:43.569 --> 06:46.447
Excuse me, but I'm in a hurry.

06:47.281 --> 06:48.658
What was that?

06:49.117 --> 06:53.037
Hey, that's an expensive suit
you have there.

06:53.246 --> 06:54.831
It hurts my eyes.

06:55.164 --> 06:57.708
Your face looks pale.

06:57.959 --> 07:00.336
It's like you're going to die.

07:04.048 --> 07:05.633
Say something.

07:05.716 --> 07:07.218
Are you already dead?

07:12.974 --> 07:14.100
Yachan!

07:14.392 --> 07:16.185
What did you do to my brother?

07:16.602 --> 07:19.021
Honey, he's dead!

07:19.272 --> 07:21.107
Yachan isn't breathing.

07:23.067 --> 07:23.985
Why you...

07:43.504 --> 07:46.841
Do I look that horrible to you?

07:48.926 --> 07:51.304
Is my face pale?

07:53.598 --> 07:55.391
Do I look weak?

07:56.684 --> 07:59.562
Do I look like I can't live long?

08:00.271 --> 08:02.315
That I'm going to die soon?

08:05.067 --> 08:07.653
No.

08:08.529 --> 08:12.658
I am the one and only life form
that is on the verge of perfection.

08:24.295 --> 08:28.424
If I supply you with a good amount
of blood, do you know what will happen?

08:36.891 --> 08:40.978
A human body is simply unable
to sustain such a drastic change.

08:45.691 --> 08:47.985
It damages your cells.

09:07.964 --> 09:13.553
I want you to kill the demon slayer
wearing hanafuda earrings.

09:15.096 --> 09:16.180
Is that clear?

09:16.847 --> 09:17.848
Yes, sir.

09:18.015 --> 09:19.225
As you wish, sir.

09:30.278 --> 09:32.363
Those earrings...

09:38.160 --> 09:39.912
Listen up!

09:40.162 --> 09:41.080
It's...

09:41.247 --> 09:44.875
It's not that you haven't paid me,

09:45.251 --> 09:48.546
but that you've wasted my udon!

09:48.629 --> 09:50.131
You have to pay for that!

09:50.548 --> 09:53.175
I'm sorry. Please give me another one.

09:53.342 --> 09:54.969
-Will you eat it?
-Yes.

09:55.553 --> 09:57.638
-Are you sure?
-Yes, I am!

09:58.014 --> 09:59.098
Good!

09:59.307 --> 10:00.516
So will you!

10:00.600 --> 10:03.311
Put down that tube
if you want some of my udon.

10:03.394 --> 10:04.979
What's that tube for anyway?

10:05.354 --> 10:07.356
Chopsticks! Use chopsticks!

10:09.358 --> 10:10.818
Can I have my udon now?

10:10.901 --> 10:12.486
Two bowls for me!

10:12.945 --> 10:13.904
Sure.

10:28.711 --> 10:30.171
Thank you for the meal.

10:30.671 --> 10:32.131
That was delicious.

10:32.590 --> 10:35.092
Glad that you appreciated it,
you get that?

10:35.384 --> 10:36.510
Come again soon!

10:38.596 --> 10:41.474
I'm sorry, Nezuko, for leaving you there.

10:43.267 --> 10:45.186
What is it, Nezuko?

10:53.361 --> 10:55.071
Are you waiting for me?

10:55.738 --> 10:59.450
I've been instructed to take you there.

11:00.159 --> 11:02.036
I can smell my way there.

11:02.370 --> 11:05.206
It's a place that is cast
with a Blindfold spell.

11:05.831 --> 11:07.208
Do you think you can find it?

11:07.541 --> 11:08.918
Blindfold?

11:09.752 --> 11:11.003
Besides that,

11:12.671 --> 11:14.924
isn't she a demon too?

11:15.549 --> 11:17.051
She looks hideous.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.763
Hideous?

11:21.222 --> 11:22.264
Hideous?

11:22.848 --> 11:24.475
Is he pointing at some ugly woman?

11:25.017 --> 11:26.060
Who?

11:29.563 --> 11:30.731
Nezuko?

11:31.399 --> 11:33.067
She's not hideous!

11:33.234 --> 11:35.653
Take a good look at her face.

11:35.736 --> 11:39.156
Nezuko was a popular beauty
back where we came from, you know!

11:42.076 --> 11:43.035
Come along.

11:43.119 --> 11:46.872
Of course I will, but Nezuko is not ugly!

11:47.623 --> 11:50.292
You'll see her once we go
somewhere brighter.

11:50.376 --> 11:53.003
Wait, let's go there, okay?

11:58.717 --> 12:00.136
I see it now.

12:00.219 --> 12:01.887
It's because of her mouthpiece, right?

12:01.971 --> 12:03.973
Maybe it's the mouthpiece
that made her look ugly.

12:04.056 --> 12:07.726
But someday you'll see
what she looks like without it.

12:10.771 --> 12:13.357
Hurry up, while no one is around.

12:24.743 --> 12:27.079
There's a big house beyond the dead end.

12:27.496 --> 12:28.581
Hurry!

12:28.956 --> 12:29.957
Heads up.

12:30.040 --> 12:32.543
Don't be rude when you see my master.

12:32.918 --> 12:35.713
I don't care if you're dead or alive,

12:35.796 --> 12:38.716
but she instructed me to take you along.

12:42.803 --> 12:43.888
Come in.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.474
I'm home.

12:47.183 --> 12:48.309
Good to see you again.

12:50.394 --> 12:53.105
Thank you for taking the trouble
to help me.

12:53.481 --> 12:54.648
And the lady...

12:55.274 --> 12:57.151
She's fine now.

12:58.319 --> 13:00.404
But I pity her husband.

13:00.488 --> 13:02.156
He's in the dungeon now.

13:06.911 --> 13:08.662
You're treating humans.

13:09.288 --> 13:10.748
Isn't that hard for you?

13:13.209 --> 13:17.630
Are you saying that we demons
crave for flesh and blood

13:17.755 --> 13:19.965
as we treat human beings?

13:21.759 --> 13:22.843
I'm sorry.

13:23.886 --> 13:25.221
Be nice to our guests.

13:25.304 --> 13:27.097
Why do you have to be so rough on them?

13:29.892 --> 13:31.727
I haven't introduced myself.

13:32.228 --> 13:34.271
My name is Tamayo.

13:34.772 --> 13:36.315
The boy is Yushiro.

13:36.524 --> 13:38.526
I hope you can get along.

13:43.948 --> 13:45.533
Get along? No way!

13:46.075 --> 13:47.660
It's not hard on me at all.

13:49.245 --> 13:52.206
I think I'm much gentler
than the average demon.

13:53.249 --> 13:56.961
It's because I have extensively
reformed my body.

13:58.003 --> 14:00.297
I even freed myself
from Kibutsuji's curse.

14:01.966 --> 14:03.133
Curse?

14:03.217 --> 14:05.594
You reformed your body?

14:13.644 --> 14:14.645
This way.

14:19.024 --> 14:21.360
Nezuko, behave yourself.

14:22.820 --> 14:24.113
It's okay.

14:24.321 --> 14:25.698
Just relax.

14:26.866 --> 14:28.158
Sorry about that.

14:28.701 --> 14:31.370
Now, what were we on about?

14:31.912 --> 14:35.624
We made ourselves survive
without eating people.

14:36.667 --> 14:39.670
All we need is just a few drops
of human blood.

14:40.087 --> 14:41.088
You drink blood?

14:41.964 --> 14:43.048
So you're...

14:43.549 --> 14:45.801
Perhaps you're feeling disturbed.

14:46.385 --> 14:51.098
We buy blood from cash-strapped people
under the guise of blood transfusion.

14:51.432 --> 14:55.477
Of course, it's not so much as to cause
any trouble to their bodies.

14:56.395 --> 14:57.563
I see.

14:57.980 --> 15:02.109
So this is why they don't have
the sort of scent that demons have.

15:02.693 --> 15:05.362
But still, they need their fix
of human blood.

15:06.405 --> 15:08.574
If it's just blood, then Nezuko too can...

15:09.617 --> 15:12.870
Meanwhile, Yushiro needs even less blood.

15:13.203 --> 15:15.456
I turned him into a demon.

15:15.915 --> 15:19.209
What, you turned him? But...

15:21.170 --> 15:22.463
Yes.

15:23.047 --> 15:27.176
It's said that no other demon
can create new demons besides Kibutsuji.

15:27.843 --> 15:29.845
In general, that's true.

15:30.846 --> 15:33.015
In the 200 years I have spent,

15:33.098 --> 15:36.268
Yushiro is the only one I've created.

15:39.229 --> 15:40.189
Two...

15:41.857 --> 15:43.192
Two hundred years?

15:44.068 --> 15:48.989
You spent 200 years to create a demon
and Yushiro is the only one?

15:49.156 --> 15:50.950
How old are you, Ms. Tamayo?

15:52.284 --> 15:54.912
Never ask a woman her age, you fool!

15:54.995 --> 15:56.205
That hurts.

15:56.288 --> 15:57.289
Yushiro.

15:57.456 --> 16:00.000
I will punish you
if you harm this boy again.

16:00.876 --> 16:01.835
Understood.

16:03.045 --> 16:05.339
She's graceful even when she's angry.

16:07.174 --> 16:10.344
There's something
I need to be clear with you about.

16:11.136 --> 16:13.889
It is not my intention
to increase the population of demons.

16:14.765 --> 16:17.184
But for those who have
little chance of survival

16:17.351 --> 16:19.436
due to terminal illness
or severe injuries,

16:19.520 --> 16:21.146
this is the only way to treat them.

16:22.272 --> 16:24.441
So whenever I meet someone
under these circumstances,

16:24.525 --> 16:28.737
I'll ask if they would like to be a demon
so they'll live long without aging.

16:33.784 --> 16:37.204
There's nothing suspicious at all
about her pure-hearted scent.

16:38.038 --> 16:39.623
I think I can trust her.

16:41.125 --> 16:42.418
Ms. Tamayo.

16:43.836 --> 16:47.756
Is there a way to turn humans who have
become demons back to humans?

17:05.357 --> 17:06.734
Do you see it?

17:08.152 --> 17:09.403
Yes, I do.

17:09.862 --> 17:11.739
I see footprints.

17:12.614 --> 17:14.575
This is it.

17:18.162 --> 17:20.998
There's an enclosure up ahead.

17:24.501 --> 17:29.506
There are three people
and they have a huge box.

17:32.551 --> 17:35.095
How should we kill him?

17:37.264 --> 17:39.016
I can feel the power flowing within me.

17:39.433 --> 17:42.936
I owe it all to our lord
for giving me his blood.

17:44.354 --> 17:47.608
Of course we're going to give him
an agonizing death.

17:49.276 --> 17:51.779
As for turning demons back into humans,

17:52.905 --> 17:53.947
there is a way.

17:54.990 --> 17:55.991
Please tell me how--

17:56.075 --> 17:59.912
Keep your distance from Lady Tamayo!

18:01.163 --> 18:02.331
Yushiro.

18:03.415 --> 18:05.250
I was just throwing him down, Lady Tamayo.

18:05.334 --> 18:06.585
I didn't punch him.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.378
It's still inappropriate.

18:08.545 --> 18:09.463
Understood.

18:09.797 --> 18:11.590
That hurts.

18:12.341 --> 18:13.717
Please tell me.

18:15.010 --> 18:17.179
Every kind of injury and disease

18:17.304 --> 18:20.432
certainly has a remedy or treatment.

18:20.849 --> 18:24.061
Although we can't turn demons
back into humans at this stage,

18:25.646 --> 18:27.147
but there will be a way.

18:29.566 --> 18:36.031
Thus, we must work to derive a treatment
by means of research.

18:37.116 --> 18:40.744
So I have a request for you.

18:42.037 --> 18:43.997
In order to create an antidote,

18:44.081 --> 18:47.042
we need a large quantity
of demon blood for research.

18:48.043 --> 18:50.462
I have two favors to ask from you.

18:51.463 --> 18:52.381
Firstly,

18:52.756 --> 18:55.467
I want your approval
to examine your sister's blood.

18:56.093 --> 18:57.094
Secondly,

18:57.261 --> 19:00.806
I hope you can try your best
to harvest the blood from demons

19:01.014 --> 19:02.975
who have a thick amount
of Kibutsuji's blood.

19:04.226 --> 19:08.647
Nezuko is currently under
a very rare peculiar condition.

19:09.314 --> 19:12.025
You said she was in a coma for two years.

19:12.317 --> 19:15.154
I suppose that her body has experienced
changes throughout the time.

19:16.238 --> 19:19.241
Usually for such a long time,

19:19.324 --> 19:23.036
if a demon has no access
to human or animal flesh for food,

19:23.120 --> 19:25.706
it will undoubtedly grow more aggressive.

19:26.456 --> 19:28.917
Lady Tamayo has remained gorgeous today.

19:29.334 --> 19:31.461
She'll definitely be gorgeous tomorrow.

19:32.421 --> 19:35.132
However, what was surprising is that

19:35.215 --> 19:37.384
Nezuko never showed any of those symptoms.

19:38.302 --> 19:41.555
This miracle should become the key
to our upcoming research.

19:42.598 --> 19:43.724
Nezuko.

19:50.189 --> 19:53.442
The second favor I asked you
will be a terrible ordeal.

19:54.943 --> 19:58.447
As for the demons who have
a thick amount of Kibutsuji's blood,

19:59.031 --> 20:03.285
those are demons who are almost
as powerful as Kibutsuji.

20:04.036 --> 20:07.039
It's not going to be easy
to harvest blood from them.

20:08.165 --> 20:09.333
That being said,

20:09.666 --> 20:12.753
do you still wish to fulfill my requests?

20:18.592 --> 20:20.427
If there's no other way,

20:20.886 --> 20:22.054
then I'll do it.

20:22.846 --> 20:25.390
If you manage to come up
with an antidote, Ms. Tamayo,

20:25.766 --> 20:27.601
after researching a lot of demon blood,

20:28.810 --> 20:30.896
it will save not only Nezuko,

20:32.064 --> 20:34.566
but even more people, am I right?

20:38.487 --> 20:39.613
Yes.

20:46.578 --> 20:47.496
Get down!

21:00.300 --> 21:02.219
So how do we kill him?

21:02.469 --> 21:04.721
Make it agonizing, of course!

22:52.954 --> 22:55.665
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

22:55.916 --> 22:58.585
I heard that Yushiro's hobby
is writing in Lady Tamayo's diary.

22:58.668 --> 23:01.922
They say that he can write
seven to ten pages per day.

23:02.506 --> 23:05.592
Somehow, I was able to obtain the diary,
so let me read it to you.

23:06.259 --> 23:07.177
Here it goes.

23:07.260 --> 23:08.220
"January 10.

23:08.303 --> 23:10.639
Lady Tamayo was fantastically
gorgeous today.

23:10.722 --> 23:14.017
At 5:10 p.m.,
she called out my name twice.

23:14.101 --> 23:15.602
Her voice was so pleasant.

23:15.685 --> 23:17.187
At 5:29 p.m.,

23:17.270 --> 23:20.690
Lady Tamayo was lost in thought
when she stumbled on an uneven road."

23:21.316 --> 23:24.277
Next, episode 9,
"Temari Demon and Arrow Demon."

23:24.361 --> 23:26.196
Pretend I didn't read his diary, okay?

23:26.905 --> 23:28.031
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.115 --> 23:29.241
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
